\f0\fs48 Function requirement :\

\fs96 				
\fs28 	The system shall validate and verify leave requests using business rules.\
					The system shall provide access to vacation requests from the previous calendar year.\
					The system shall allow vacation requests for dates up to 18 months in the future.\
					The system shall send e-mail notifications to request manager approval.\
					The system shall notify employees by e-mail of changes in their request status.\
					The system shall authenticate users through the existing portal's SSO mechanism.\
					The system shall log all transactions.\
					The system shall allow authorized HR and system administrators to override rule-restricted actions.\
					The system shall log all override actions.\
					The system shall allow managers to award personal leave within system-defined limits.					\
					The system shall allow other internal systems to query an employee's vacation request summary.\
					The system shall retrieve required employee information and changes from existing HR systems.\
					An HR clerk can add or remove nearly any record in the system.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 					A manager may award subordinates comp time, subject to certain limits set in the system.\
					If HR clerks are employees, they use two separate login IDs.
